# lecture6 — Character-level GPT Codemap

## Project Purpose
Educational character-level GPT trained on Tiny Shakespeare. Clarity over performance — every component maps directly to theory.

---

## File Map

| File | Role | Key Exports |
|---|---|---|
| `gpt.py` | Model architecture only — no I/O, no training | `GPTLanguageModel`, `Block`, `MultiHeadAttention`, `Head`, `FeedFoward` |
| `train.py` | CLI entry point; wires all components | `train()`, argparse CLI |
| `util.py` | Tokenization + dataset batching | `CharacterTokenizer`, `Dataset` |
| `loss.py` | Validation loss estimation (no_grad) | `estimate_loss()` |
| `metrics.py` | ROUGE, BERTScore, perplexity, masked accuracy | `Metrics` |

