## Class & Function Reference

### `gpt.py`

```
Head(head_size, n_embd, context_size)           [line 6]
  .forward(x, kv_cache=None) → (out, new_cache) [line 15]
  Buffers: tril (causal mask)

MultiHeadAttention(num_heads, head_size, n_embd, context_size) [line 40]
  .forward(x, kv_cache=None) → (out, new_caches) [line 47]
  Children: heads (ModuleList[Head]), proj (Linear), dropout

FeedFoward(n_embd)                              [line 58]
  .forward(x) → x                               [line 68]
  Net: Linear(n_embd → 4*n_embd) → ReLU → Linear(4*n_embd → n_embd) → Dropout

Block(n_embd, n_head, context_size)             [line 72]
  .forward(x, kv_cache=None) → (x, new_cache)  [line 82]
  Pre-LN: ln1 → sa (MultiHeadAttention) → residual
          ln2 → ffwd (FeedFoward)        → residual

GPTLanguageModel(vocab_size, n_embd, context_size, n_head, n_layer) [line 89]
  .forward(idx, targets=None, use_cache=False, kv_cache=None)       [line 139]
    → (logits, loss)           if use_cache=False
    → (logits, loss, caches)   if use_cache=True
  .generate(start_idx, number_of_tokens, use_cache=False)           [line 101]
    → idx tensor (B, T + number_of_tokens)
  Embeddings: token_embedding_table, position_embedding_table
  Stack: blocks (ModuleList[Block] × n_layer) → ln_f → lm_head
```

