## Data Flow

```
input.txt
  └─► CharacterTokenizer        (util.py:4)
        vocab, encode/decode
  └─► torch.tensor(encode(...)) (train.py:78)
        1-D LongTensor of token indices
  └─► Dataset                   (util.py:17)
        train/val split 90/10
        get_batch → (B, T) x and y tensors

(B, T) x
  └─► GPTLanguageModel.forward  (gpt.py:139)
        token_emb + pos_emb → x (B,T,n_embd)
        for each Block:
          LayerNorm → MultiHeadAttention → + residual
          LayerNorm → FeedFoward         → + residual
        ln_f → lm_head → logits (B,T,vocab_size)
        cross_entropy(logits, targets) → scalar loss

loss → optimizer.step()         (train.py:24)
```

