## KV-Cache Logic (generation only)

```
generate() loop per new token:
  if cache exists AND cache length < context_size:
    feed only last token: idx[:, -1:]    O(1) attention
  else:
    feed full window: idx[:, -context_size:]
    rebuild cache from scratch

Head.forward with kv_cache:
  k = cat([k_prev, k_new], dim=1)
  v = cat([v_prev, v_new], dim=1)
  causal mask applied to new query rows only
```

